-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §69: every existing principal, non-academic
-- too, moves to the reform's structure when the reform is applied in his
-- school, and his pay is converted.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `69`

@ref akn:art_69
GIVEN `an existing principal` IS A BOOLEAN, `the reform is applied in his school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal moves to the reform` `an existing principal` `the reform is applied in his school` IF
    `an existing principal` AND `the reform is applied in his school`

#ASSERT `the principal moves to the reform` TRUE TRUE
